{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52186","headline":"颂六十二首 十一 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云南北竟无归，子客东西何可依。\n原宪糟糖窃有望，田氏膏腴讵敢希。\n蔼蔼庑庭绝车马，寂寂蓬门掩席扉。\n宿昔偷光恡余照，今日穷途空自欺。\n（同书同卷《贫贱部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}